t":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":746700101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":2984254010,"text":"まだ改善の余地があるね…圧力の具合がよくない。材料は同じなのに、加工方法が違うからか？閉塞鍛造と密閉鍛造と…","nextNodeIds":[746700102]},{"nodeId":746700102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":3393561210,"text":"となると、先に圧力を設定すれば…いや、加工方法に応じて自動調整するシステムを作るべきだろうか？","nextNodeIds":[746700103]},{"nodeId":746700103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3115402578,"text":"へえ、近くで見ても不思議だな。こんな風に「カーンカーン」って自動で鉄を打つ機械があったら、鍛冶職人なんか要らなくなっちゃうんじゃないのか？","nextNodeIds":[746700104]},{"nodeId":746700104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":760162546,"text":"ハハッ、この機械は「職人いらず」と言えるほど、まだ賢くないんだよ。使うたびに細かい調整が必要だし、後の焼入れや研磨作業は人手に頼ってるからね。","nextNodeIds":[746700105]},{"nodeId":746700105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":1968097562,"text":"でもいつか絶対、こいつを全自動の鍛造機械にしてみせるさ。","nextNodeIds":[746700106]},{"nodeId":746700106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":1978114178,"text":"どうだい、何か鍛造を依頼したいものはあるかい？","nextNodeIds":[746700107]},{"nodeId":746700107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4101306354,"text":"オートスミスの性能次第だね…","nextNodeIds":[746700108]},{"nodeId":746700108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":1700838106,"text":"そこまで言うなら、腕前を披露しようじゃないの！","nextNodeIds":[746700109]},{"nodeId":746700109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3172375618,"text":"ん？おまえってここのオーナーってだけじゃなくて、鍛冶職人でもあるのか？","nextNodeIds":[746700110]},{"nodeId":746700110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":1433677194,"text":"ああ、アタシはここのオーナー兼、鍛冶職人さ。見た目によらず、だろ？","nextNodeIds":[746700111]},{"nodeId":746700111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":111427338,"text":"そりゃあ初対面の人はみんなびっくりされるけど。「普通の人より痩せてるし、腕もムキムキじゃないのに」ってね。","nextNodeIds":[746700112]},{"nodeId":746700112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4086274666,"text":"うんうん、そんなやつにホントに鍛冶職人なんてできるのかよって…あ、そんな風に思ってなかったのに、ついおまえの話に釣られちゃったぞ。","nextNodeIds":[746700113]},{"nodeId":746700113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":4075358322,"text":"あははっ、いいんだって。なにを隠そう、ガリガリのアタシに鍛冶職人が務まるのは、この機械のおかげさ。","nextNodeIds":[746700114]},{"nodeId":746700114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":1989383490,"text":"人類は道具を使える。緻密に設計された道具が、不可能を可能に変えるのさ。","nextNodeIds":[746700115]},{"nodeId":746700115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":452990530,"text":"機械には職人の魂がないっていうけど、アタシからすれば機械もハンマーも道具に違いない。そんな風に言うなら、素手で叩いてみろって話だよ…","nextNodeIds":[746700116]},{"nodeId":746700116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":1178543346,"text":"おっと、話が逸れたね。よし、今から切れ味抜群の剣を作ってみせてやる…あ、でも材料が足りないな。","nextNodeIds":[746700117]},{"nodeId":746700117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":3061527450,"text":"あちゃー、テストで材料を使いすぎたな。どうしよっかな…","nextNodeIds":[746700118]},{"nodeId":746700118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4095571210,"text":"わかったぞ！次は謎のおっきなレバーを動かすんだろ。そしたら鍛造機が「ゴゴゴッ」ってクロックワーク·マシナリーになって、自分で材料を探しに行くんだ！","nextNodeIds":[746700119]},{"nodeId":746700119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":832472274,"text":"うーん…自動で材料を探す機能は、確かに必要だよな。材料の識別はどうする？表面の反射光で材質を判断するとか？","nextNodeIds":[746700120]},{"nodeId":746700120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1885130426,"text":"エスタブレ？","nextNodeIds":[746700121]},{"nodeId":746700121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":4085342770,"text":"あ、悪い。ぼーっとしてた。オートスミスは鍛造をするだけの機械だから、変形して歩くのは無理だ。材料は誰かに持ってきてもらわなきゃ…","nextNodeIds":[746700122]},{"nodeId":746700122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1624232130,"text":"そっか…","nextNodeIds":[746700123]},{"nodeId":746700123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":2519528618,"text":"そうそう、あんたらも色んな材料を手に入れたら、ここに持ってきてくれ。テストしながら機械の調整をしてると、材料がいくらあっても足りなくってね。","nextNodeIds":[746700124]},{"nodeId":746700124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":3821513162,"text":"お礼に…工房の製品設計図をあげよう！","nextNodeIds":[746700125,746700126]},{"nodeId":746700125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":126491466,"text":"企業秘密のにおいがする…","nextNodeIds":[746700127]},{"nodeId":746700127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":2458747634,"text":"なんつうかさ。アタシにとっちゃ、大事なのは鍛造した「製品」じゃなくて、鍛造の「道具」なんだよな。","nextNodeIds":[746700128]},{"nodeId":746700128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":3994534034,"text":"オートスミスを色んな材料に触れさせて、データを集める。そうすりゃ、もっといい製品を作るのに役立つ。設計図の重要性は二の次だ。","nextNodeIds":[746700129]},{"nodeId":746700129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":4041858562,"text":"だから鍛造用の素材だけじゃなくて、材料になりそうなものを見つけたら、どんどん持ってきてくれよ。","nextNodeIds":[746700130]},{"nodeId":746700130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1372115994,"text":"うーん、妙な設計図をオイラたちに押し付けて、今度来たら店は空っぽで、人もオートスミスも一緒に消えてたりして…","nextNodeIds":[746700131]},{"nodeId":746700131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":3590001674,"text":"まさか。これは長期的な提携と考えてほしい。そういう関係だと、信頼が一番大事だろ。設計図の質はアタシが保証する。","nextNodeIds":[746700132]},{"nodeId":746700132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":926509562,"text":"それにアタシは逃げられても、オートスミスに足を生やすのは難しいだろ…","nextNodeIds":[746700133]},{"nodeId":746700133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1823495578,"text":"それもそうだな。","nextNodeIds":[746700134,746700135]},{"nodeId":746700134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":381636794,"text":"じゃあこれで決まり！","nextNodeIds":[746700136]},{"nodeId":746700136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","textMapHash":302794850,"text":"お互い気持ちよく仕事ができるといいね。うん、どんな材料を持ってきてくれるか楽しみにしてるよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":746700135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1393931314,"text":"今後ともよろしく！","nextNodeIds":[746700136]},{"nodeId":746700126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4065018578,"text":"本当にいいの？","nextNodeIds":[746700127]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7467001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["5033"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7467001],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5033,"speakerName":"エスタブレ","count":23},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":8},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":5}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[174670],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":4249667382,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":